-05-30T02:49:34-07:00","id":903361,"title":"","content":"You can also house rule it so that players can increase their birthrights with experience points.<br /> <br /> other than that, relics and such can be gained through play if the ST allows for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/593-gemstone","name":"Gemstone","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T06:35:06-07:00","id":903439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gemstone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/902649-god-birthrights?p=903361#post903361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can also house rule it so that players can increase their birthrights with experience points.<br /> <br /> other than that, relics and such can be gained through play if the ST allows for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is more like: &quot;what if they spent all 5 Birthright-dots and the remaining bonus points in Relics?&quot; How do they get Avatar and Sanctuary since Birthrights can't be bought with experience points?<br /> Only with houserules then?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","name":"Wickedgrail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[